tive options based on user’s input or context,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"type":"topic","title":"Components","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSImage":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsimage","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSImage","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSImage","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSImage","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSImage","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use to provide an asset to ouds in order to be added in some components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The icon can be flipped for RTL consideration and an associated "},{"type":"